WEBVTT

NOTE
Disc 2 - Scene 31h: Arrival at Ultimecia's Era and Her Castle
Duration: ~1 minute 9 seconds
Ultimecia's World - The Gateway to Disc 4
For blind and low-vision players using screen readers

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
The overwhelming chaos of Time Compression gradually stabilizes. The kaleidoscopic 
swirling of infinite realities slows and crystallizes. The party's consciousness solidifies. 
They have arrived at their destination — Ultimecia's time period, a location that exists 
outside of normal history.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
The landscape of Ultimecia's era reveals itself. The sky is perpetually dark — not the 
darkness of night, but an unnatural, sickly darkness that suggests eternal twilight. The 
sun is either dead or absent. Strange celestial objects hang in the sky — moons of 
impossible colors, stars that pulse with sickly light, fragments that seem to defy 
astronomical logic.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
The terrain is barren and desolate. The earth is dead — cracked, fissured ground with no 
vegetation whatsoever. Dust storms howl across empty plains. The air itself seems toxic and 
hostile. Boulders of black stone litter the landscape. Canyons cut deep into the earth, 
revealing only more darkness below.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
In the distance, the source of this world's dominion rises — Ultimecia's Castle. It is an 
enormous gothic fortress of impossible scale and terrifying beauty. The structure dominates 
the horizon, a towering edifice of blackened stone and twisted architecture that seems to 
pierce the unnatural sky itself.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The castle is a nightmare of design — ornate spires twist upward like claws reaching 
heavenward. Gargoyles perch on the highest points, their stone forms watching the approach 
with unsettling stillness. Massive turrets buttress the walls. The architecture is baroque 
and excessive, every surface covered in detail and decoration.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Stained glass windows glow with eerie purple and red light from within, casting colored 
shadows across the castle's exterior. The light suggests the presence of power within — 
Ultimecia herself, inhabiting this fortress as the ruler of this broken era.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
The castle floats above a massive dark chasm. There is no visible ground beneath it, only 
an endless void of shadow and darkness. The separation between the castle and the mainland 
is bridged by a single structure — an enormous chain-link bridge of medieval design.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
The bridge itself is a feat of architecture — thick iron chains support a wooden platform, 
spanning the chasm in a single, massive arc. The chains are weathered and ancient, covered 
in rust and patina. The bridge sways slightly, as if moved by wind that the party cannot 
feel. Walking it will be precarious.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:45.000
The party stands at the beginning of the bridge. The castle looms ahead, seeming to grow 
larger with each passing moment. The bridge stretches before them like a path to destiny — 
the final walkway to the ultimate confrontation.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:50.000
The camera sweeps around the imposing castle structure, revealing its terrifying scale and 
dark beauty from multiple angles. The fortress is massive beyond comprehension — its walls 
extend hundreds of feet high. The detail and craftsmanship are undeniably magnificent, but 
the overall impression is one of malice and evil intent.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.000
The sky swirls with sickly colors around the castle's spires. The clouds, if they can be 
called clouds, pulse with an angry purple-red light. The entire atmosphere is oppressive 
and hostile. This is a place where the normal rules of nature do not apply.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
The party steels themselves for what lies ahead. They have passed through Time Compression 
itself. They have crossed impossible distances and survived the unraveling of reality. Now 
they face their greatest challenge — to ascend the bridge, enter the castle, and confront 
Ultimecia herself.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:09.000
Squall takes the first step onto the bridge. His resolve is absolute. Behind him, Rinoa, 
Zell, Quistis, Selphie, and Irvine follow. Together, they walk across the chain-link bridge 
toward the castle, toward their final destiny, toward the moment that will determine the 
fate of all time itself. Ultimecia's Castle waits, silent and menacing, for its visitors 
to arrive.
